  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality feed for Nigerian livestock</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aquaculture and livestock farming are growing business activities in Nigeria. Premixed feed at high prices is not attainable for small farmers and limits the profitability and production. Single Spark has created an app to support farmers and feed millers to produce quality feed for their animals. The app calculates the optimum mix of attainable ingredients. DGGF-TA funded a market validation and scale up of the app in Nigeria. The project lead to a change in business model, making the app free and easily accessible to farmers. With the market validation, 3 direct and 4 indirect jobs were supported. 600 farmers have received training on how to use the app and how to create the most optimized feed for their animals.</narrative>
  </description>
